{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Baal-shittim.</b> For so it is written, \"and they encamped by the Jordan from Beth-jeshimoth to Abel-shittim,\" and all in the plains of Moab, for they did not move from there. Also Joshua sent spies from there." "And in my opinion <b>vayachel</b> is from the heavy [intensive] binyan added [i.e., the Hif'il, with dagesh in the second root letter]."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:24.009419219Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}